{"id":"wb-5-472","name":"克孜尔尕哈石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"克孜尔尕哈石窟","text":"克孜尔尕（gǎ）哈石窟是古代龟兹国石窟，和克孜尔石窟（即克孜尔千佛洞）、库木吐拉石窟、森木赛姆石窟、阿艾石窟同为龟兹石窟的重要组成部分，位于今中国新疆库车市西北，始建于5世纪。附近有克孜尔尕哈烽燧。\n克孜尔尕哈石窟现存54个洞窟，46个编号洞，分布在东西宽170米、南北长300米内的崖壁上，是“丝绸之路”上重要的一处佛教文化遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%B0%95%E5%93%88%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":88052729,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88052729","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/97fa8d552b9c999acbc862c5.png","title":"Qizil_Qagha_Cave_(20220610).png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qizil_Qagha_Cave_(20220610).png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/Qizil_Qagha_Cave_%2820220610%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Este Momento","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​克孜尔尕哈千佛洞","width":320,"height":240}}